  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "While Zhao Lian Yun is still a mortal under Wei tribe betrothal pressure, she names Dou E as the person who killed her father and as a higher-up of the Ma tribe alliance she cannot rely on.",
      "chapters": [
        529
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_zhao_lian_yun",
        "fac_ma_tribe"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "He turns into a giant crocodile. He opens his mouth and shoots teeth that embed and explode.",
      "chapters": [
        583
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "appearance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "After Hei Lou Lan wins the contest and opens Eighty-Eight True Yang Building, his recruitment roll names Dou E with Fang Yuan under the Chang Shan Yin name, Tai Bai Yun Sheng, and other rank five experts.",
      "chapters": [
        582
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "hei-lou-lans-expert-roll",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_hei_lou_lan",
        "house_eighty_eight_true_yang_building",
        "char_fang_yuan",
        "char_chang_shan_yin",
        "char_tai_bai_yun_sheng"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "In the flying bear fight he joins the third-step charge as a transformation path Gu Master, turns into a giant crocodile while battling and retreating, and shoots exploding teeth into the phantom with Gu Guo Long and Tao You.",
      "chapters": [
        583
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "hei-lou-lans-expert-roll",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "sys_gu_master",
